			"strokeColor": "#7ee787",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"text": "🔹 $ python -m src\n🔹 Python looks for src/__main__.py\n🔹 Executes it under __name__ == \"__main__\"\n🔹 Calls cli.main() which parses argv and runs\npipeline",
			"fontSize": 12,
